---

<Layout title="About" theme="dark">
  <section class="bg-black text-merino py-5vh">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-8 items-center justify-center">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 items-center">
        <h1 class="font-heading text-5xl sm:text-7xl text-center">Hosted by</h1>
        <img
          class="w-36 sm:w-60"
          src="https://res.cloudinary.com/letsstopaids/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/MonrealYouthForce/letsstopaids"
          alt="LetsStopAIDS"
        />
      </div>
      <div class="bg-red h-0.5 w-5/6 sm:w-80 rounded-3xl"></div>
      <ol class="font-heading text-xl sm:text-2xl">
        {
          tblContents.map((item) => (
            <li class="pt-1">
              <small class="text-sm font-subheading pr-1">{item.index}</small>
              <a data-scroll-to data-scroll-to-duration="2" href={item.path}>
                {item.label}
              </a>
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section id="about" class="bg-black text-merino pt-10vh p-10vw">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
      <h2 class="font-heading text-4xl sm:text-6xl">About</h2>
      <h3 class="font-subheading font-bold text-3xl">
        The Youth Force is a global platform for young people to take part in
        the International AIDS Conference as youth advocates and leaders.
      </h3>
      <div class="flex items-center">
        <p class="text-lg">
          This year the Youth Force is hosted by LetsStopAIDS and is made up of
          55 individuals representing over 18 countries. It is a collective of
          over 12 local and international youth-led and youth-serving AIDS
          Service organizations that are committed to creating a safe space for
          young people at the conference. Young people are not a homogeneous
          group; we are strong in our diversity. The YouthForce brings young
          people from different communities together to collectively learn,
          network and advocate.
        </p>
        <img
          class="hidden sm:block px-5vw h-auto"
          src="https://res.cloudinary.com/letsstopaids/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/MonrealYouthForce/peace-sign"
          alt="Peace sign"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section id="schedule" class="bg-merino text-red px-5vw py-10vh">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 md:flex-row pb-5vh">
      {
        schedule.map((item) => (
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 w-full">
            <h2 class="text-red font-body font-bold text-3xl text-center">
              {item.date}
            </h2>
            <table>
              <tbody class="text-merino grid auto-rows-fr">
                {item.rows.map((row) => (
                  <tr class={`bg-[${row.colour}] flex`}>
                    <td class="basis-[45%] p-2.5 text-sm">{row.time}</td>
                    <td class="basis-[55%] p-2.5">
                      <p class="text-lg leading-5">{row.activity}</p>
                      <p class="text-xs">{row.description}</p>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                ))}
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
        ))
      }
    </div>
    <Button
      src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/62b21b4144a242c86743072f/62e4a0da16c2b17f6f0570fa_MYF%20Schedule%20(1).pdf"
      text="Schedule (PDF)"
    />
  </section>
  <section
    id="pre-conference"
    class="bg-merino text-grey px-5vw md:px-10vw py-10vh"
  >
    <article>
      <!-- ! Text is misaligned -->
      <div class="flex items-end flex-col sm:flex-row pb-4">
        <div class="flex items-end">
          <img
            class="w-5"
            src="https://res.cloudinary.com/letsstopaids/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/MonrealYouthForce/ribbon-curl-vertical"
            alt="ribbon curl"
          />
          <h2
            class="font-heading text-black text-5xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl"
          >
            Pre-Conference
          </h2>
        </div>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-red text-6xl md:text-7xl lg:text-9xl">
          28.07.22
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="text-2xl font-semibold">
        <p>
          <time datetime="2022-07-28">July 28, 2022</time>
        </p>
        <p>
          <time datetime="14:00">2:00PM</time> to <time datetime="17:30"
            >5:30PM</time
          >
        </p>
      </div>
      <!-- ! Original page has black text, but website uses grey in other pages  -->
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 text-grey text-lg pt-8">
        <h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold">Our Aim</h3>
        <p>
          To prepare youth participants for the main conference and teach them
          the necessary advocacy skills to advocate for themselves at the
          conference.
        </p>
        <p>
          The Youth Pre-Conference will convene youth and adolescents to network
          and gain the resources necessary for youth to continue their
          programmatic work, advocacy, and research in both their respective
          communities and during the AIDS 2022 conference. The Pre-Conference
          will bring together young activists from around the world in all their
          diversities to advance the HIV and AIDS response. It will aim to
          centre inclusivity, justice, equity, and strengthen youth engagement
          at AIDS 2022.
        </p>
        <p>
          The Youth Pre-Conference will prepare youth for the main conference,
          engage with young people providing them a platform to network, share
          and learn from one another and experts in the field, and offer a place
          for skill building including advocacy skills to facilitate advancement
          of adolescent and youth priorities within their communities at the
          conference.
        </p>
        <p>
          One of the flagship initiatives of the Youth Pre-Conference will also
          be to develop a Youth Position Statement, co-created with young
          activists and youth and adolescent-led organizations with messaging on
          meaningful youth and adolescent engagement. Are you interested in
          co-creating the Youth Position Statement? Indicate your interest <a
            href="https://forms.gle/zndTAwrBMaHziPiA6"
            class="text-red underline"
            target="_blank">here</a
          >.
        </p>
        <p>
          All registrants for AIDS 2022 are able to participate in the
          Pre-Conference. For more information, please contact Erika (<a
            href="mailto:edupuis@ryerson.ca"
            class="text-red underline"
            target="_blank">edupuis@ryerson.ca</a
          >) or Mitchell (<a
            href="mailto:direction@p10.qc.ca"
            class="text-red underline"
            target="_blank">direction@p10.qc.ca</a
          >).
        </p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </section>
  <!-- ! Text bleeds over on smaller screens, font is too wide -->
  <section
    id="youth-pavilion"
    class="bg-merino text-grey px-5vw md:px-10vw py-10vh pb-10vw"
  >
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-[5vw]">
      <article class="flex flex-col gap-4 text-grey text-lg">
        <h2 class="font-heading text-black text-6xl">Youth Pavilion</h2>
        <div class="text-2xl font-semibold leading-8">
          <p>
            <time datetime="2022-07-30">July 30</time> - <time
              datetime="2022-08-01">Aug 1, 2022</time
            >
          </p>
          <p>
            <time datetime="10:30:00">10:30AM</time> to <time
              datetime="18:00:00">6:00PM</time
            >
          </p>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold pt-4">
          What is the Youth Pavilion?
        </h3>
        <p>
          A space for young people to network, collaborate and showcase
          achievements from around the world. In the Pavilion, a variety of
          activities will be held which will include workshops, networking
          events, performances and exhibitions.
        </p>
      </article>
      <div
        class="flex flex-col items-end gap-2 sm:gap-4 font-heading text-6xl md:text-7xl lg:text-9xl text-red"
      >
        <div class="flex justify-end items-end">
          <h3 class="leading-10 md:leading-[48px] lg:leading-[85px]">
            30.07.22
          </h3>
          <img
            src="https://res.cloudinary.com/letsstopaids/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/MonrealYouthForce/ribbon-curl-horizontal"
            alt="ribbon curl"
          />
        </div>
        <h3>01.08.22</h3>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section id="youth-reception" class="bg-black text-merino px-5vw py-10vw">
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
      <div class="font-heading text-6xl md:text-7xl lg:text-9xl text-red">
        <h2>31.07.22</h2>
      </div>
      <article class="flex flex-col gap-4 text-merino text-lg">
        <h2 class="font-heading text-6xl">Youth Reception🎉</h2>
        <div class="text-2xl font-semibold leading-8">
          <p><time datetime="2022-07-31">July 31st, 2022</time></p>
          <p>
            <time datetime="16:00:00">4PM</time> to <time datetime="18:00:00"
              >6PM</time
            >
          </p>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold pt-4">
          What is the Youth Pavilion?
        </h3>
        <p>
          This is an evening wine reception✨ to celebrate young people and give
          them the opportunity to meet stakeholders in an informal setting.
        </p>
        <p>Make sure to register to attend!</p>
        <div>
          <Button
            src="https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/aids-2022-youth-reception-tickets-387009775657"
            text="Register here"
            bgColour="bg-merino"
            fontColour="text-black"
          />
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
